      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAXIMEZ (9) made an encouraging return to racing when just a nose away in second at Ballarat in his first outing for six months. Draws on the back row but has won when second-up before so progression is likely. IDEOLOGY (4) was let down by manners in both outings of the Vicbred Super Series but had won three in a row in SA prior. Strikes at 50 per cent at this distance. Big chance if he gets it right. LORD LOGAN (7) raced parked from a similar draw to this and boxed on for second at Kilmore last week. Had won three of his previous four, one of them at this circuit and distance. Must be included. AMOUR MATERNAL (1) has put three placings together, coming from this barrier to miss narrowly two back. Go well again.",
